{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cgk9KdmGfsADTBZRUjU3t", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Eight services are affected by a change to UserService: three depend on it directly and five more depend on it through OrderService.\n\nThe graph server only looks one hop at a time, even though I asked for 4. So I queried each service it returned until every branch reached a service that nothing depends on. That last service was 3 hops out, so the list below should be complete.\n\n**Direct dependents (1 hop)**\n- ApiGateway: ApiGateway \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService\n- AuditService: AuditService \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService\n- OrderService: OrderService \u2192 DEPENDS_ON \u2192 UserService\n\n**2 hops (through OrderService)**\n- BillingService: BillingService \u2192 OrderService \u2192 UserService\n- ReportingService: ReportingService \u2192 OrderService \u2192 UserService. It also reaches UserService through BillingService.\n- SearchService: SearchService \u2192 OrderService \u2192 UserService\n- ApiGateway also calls OrdersAPI, which OrderService exposes. That's a second route to UserService, but ApiGateway is already listed as a direct dependent.\n\n**3 hops (through BillingService)**\n- RenewalsWorker: RenewalsWorker \u2192 BillingService \u2192 OrderService \u2192 UserService\n\nOrderService is the main source of the wider impact: changes to UserService that reach OrderService's behaviour or the OrdersAPI will spread to billing, reporting, search and renewals.\n\nAffected services: ApiGateway, AuditService, OrderService, BillingService, ReportingService, SearchService, RenewalsWorker"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 129, "cache_read_input_tokens": 33496, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 129}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "0cd6cd11-b2d1-478c-a458-59320518378c", "uuid": "36f36a7a-268e-470c-ac50-9c497be812b1", "timestamp": "2026-11-05T17:04:39.709Z", "request_id": "req_011Cgk9KdYsn7nfNA1fay25Z"}
